WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:05.300
Prétear

00:40.940 --> 00:43.780
Takako, I'm glad you're safe.

00:49.950 --> 00:55.120
I won't betray you.

00:56.160 --> 00:59.300
Your sins are my sins.

00:59.300 --> 01:01.500
I'll bear them all.

01:01.500 --> 01:06.090
That moment, when I gave up my knighthood, I decided that.

01:07.140 --> 01:11.910
Sixteen years ago, I couldn't protect you.

01:11.910 --> 01:15.280
This is my penance.

01:16.750 --> 01:18.120
Sasame...

01:18.120 --> 01:24.110
Was I finally able to become your Knight?

01:30.290 --> 01:31.560
Sasame...

01:46.440 --> 01:49.900
The Legend of White Snow

01:50.350 --> 01:51.720
Hurry! This way!

01:51.720 --> 01:52.880
Thanks!

01:58.590 --> 01:59.750
What the?!

02:00.490 --> 02:02.690
Did the Great Tree fall asleep?

02:02.690 --> 02:04.490
No, it's confused.

02:04.490 --> 02:08.570
It doesn't know where the power it wants went to.

02:08.570 --> 02:10.600
Sasame! Hang on!

02:10.600 --> 02:12.800
What should...

02:12.800 --> 02:15.110
What should I do?

02:15.110 --> 02:17.470
Abandon your hatred.

02:18.040 --> 02:25.710
Hatred is something which only hurts you and makes you suffer.

02:27.550 --> 02:30.210
You've suffered enough.

02:31.420 --> 02:36.350
Your heart continued to suffer, even after you became the Princess of Disaster.

02:38.660 --> 02:42.560
Himeno was the one who made me realize that.

02:43.570 --> 02:49.910
Himeno, I was the one who didn't understand Mawata's feelings.

02:49.910 --> 02:51.710
Mawata's safe.

02:51.710 --> 02:54.270
I see, thank goodness.

02:55.010 --> 02:58.250
I've done an awful thing to her.

02:58.250 --> 03:02.510
It's not a sin which can be atoned for with my life.

03:03.350 --> 03:07.150
No! Don't die! Please, Sasame!

03:08.760 --> 03:10.660
Hayate! Let's prét!

03:10.660 --> 03:13.100
A Prétear can send Leafe to Sasame!

03:13.100 --> 03:15.970
You're in no condition to do that! You want to die?

03:15.970 --> 03:17.060
But...

03:17.600 --> 03:21.510
Then, what about Takako? She can become a Prétear too.

03:21.510 --> 03:22.710
Takako's...

03:22.710 --> 03:26.800
Takako's powers changed sixteen years ago.

03:27.950 --> 03:32.110
She may be able to manipulate Leafe, but she can't give any.

03:33.020 --> 03:36.040
Takako, smile...

03:36.790 --> 03:38.810
...for me.

03:47.500 --> 03:49.470
You've come back,

03:49.470 --> 03:52.260
...the Takako of back then.

03:54.000 --> 03:57.570
My one and only...

03:59.710 --> 04:01.080
Sasame?

04:05.820 --> 04:08.320
Sasame! Sasame!

04:08.320 --> 04:09.410
Sasame!

04:20.100 --> 04:20.430
Hey...

04:28.510 --> 04:31.840
I'm really an idiot.

04:31.840 --> 04:34.410
I realize that now.

04:34.410 --> 04:36.910
Right, Sasame?

04:36.910 --> 04:39.820
I've never felt like this before.

04:39.820 --> 04:43.620
If you'll come back, I don't need anything else!

04:44.350 --> 04:46.890
I'll accept any punishment!

04:46.890 --> 04:50.490
I'll accept it no matter how harsh it is!

04:50.490 --> 04:54.600
It doesn't matter even if you don't love me.

04:54.600 --> 04:55.960
Come back...

04:58.600 --> 04:59.970
Takako...

05:13.350 --> 05:14.370
It's all over.

05:17.890 --> 05:19.990
Takako?

05:19.990 --> 05:21.360
It's all finished.

05:23.390 --> 05:23.990
Takako!

05:23.990 --> 05:24.550
Himeno!
Takako!

05:28.870 --> 05:29.660
Hayate!

05:33.700 --> 05:36.410
Takako's engulfed in despair.

05:36.410 --> 05:39.900
The Great Tree of Fenrir reacted to that power!

05:42.650 --> 05:43.910
The tree woke up!

05:43.910 --> 05:45.210
Hajime, Shin! Run!

05:45.620 --> 05:46.510
Mannen!

05:50.720 --> 05:51.810
Hurry and escape!

05:55.090 --> 05:56.120
No...

05:56.790 --> 05:58.300
There's no way we can escape!

05:58.300 --> 05:59.260
Mayune!

05:59.800 --> 06:00.760
Where's Himeno?

06:01.900 --> 06:03.870
What happened to Himeno?

06:03.870 --> 06:05.100
Mawata!

06:05.900 --> 06:11.000
Himeno's doing her best, fighting to save us all.

06:12.840 --> 06:14.110
Let's go back!

06:14.110 --> 06:16.410
Let's go back to where Himeno is!

06:16.410 --> 06:17.110
Mawata...

06:24.320 --> 06:25.220
Take that!

06:27.090 --> 06:29.660
Yes, I'd like to go back.

06:29.660 --> 06:31.390
We're family after all.

06:31.390 --> 06:35.850
But there's nothing we can do for her now.

06:36.400 --> 06:39.630
It's frustrating, but we would only get in her way.

06:41.070 --> 06:44.800
The only thing we can do for her...

06:45.810 --> 06:48.010
...is to live.

06:48.010 --> 06:51.820
Live, and welcome her home with laughter.

06:51.820 --> 06:52.870
Kaoru!

06:54.020 --> 06:55.950
You understand, don't you?

06:56.850 --> 06:58.190
Let's go.

06:58.190 --> 06:59.290
Wait!

06:59.290 --> 07:01.260
Dad...

07:03.290 --> 07:04.290
Mawata?

07:04.290 --> 07:06.060
I can run on my own.

07:07.200 --> 07:08.360
All right.

07:10.300 --> 07:12.870
Natsue, Mayune, Mawata, let's go!

07:12.870 --> 07:13.840
Okay!

07:22.250 --> 07:23.970
Sheesh, they finally took off.

07:30.720 --> 07:31.780
Hayate!

07:34.890 --> 07:36.950
I'll come and save you!

07:46.800 --> 07:47.600
Hayate!

07:50.110 --> 07:51.370
Sasame...

07:52.040 --> 07:53.980
Hayate! Let's prét and fight!

07:56.050 --> 07:57.410
I don't want to be beaten!

07:58.110 --> 07:59.420
Right...

07:59.420 --> 08:03.510
I still haven't fulfilled my promise.

08:53.800 --> 08:55.790
No one's at fault!

08:56.640 --> 08:59.370
Everyone just wanted to be loved!

09:00.010 --> 09:02.810
Solitude was what we all feared!

09:11.620 --> 09:12.320
Hayate!

09:12.320 --> 09:14.420
I'm all right! Don't let your guard down!

09:14.420 --> 09:15.120
Right!

09:22.770 --> 09:23.730
Hayate!

09:30.340 --> 09:32.570
I was always looking for a place where I belonged.

09:34.010 --> 09:37.670
I thought it didn't matter whether I was there or not.

09:39.050 --> 09:39.910
But...

09:40.920 --> 09:42.920
I met the Leafe Knights.

09:42.920 --> 09:44.850
I was needed.

09:48.260 --> 09:49.250
I was happy.

09:50.660 --> 09:52.750
I was taught all sorts of things.

09:54.100 --> 09:55.620
Something I can do!

09:56.870 --> 09:58.560
A place where I ought to be!

10:00.070 --> 10:02.610
That's right, everyone was there.

10:02.610 --> 10:04.510
That's why I could do my best!

10:04.510 --> 10:07.070
That's why I won't be beaten!

10:10.250 --> 10:11.870
Himeno...

10:30.200 --> 10:31.530
Everyone...

10:41.710 --> 10:43.370
Thank you, everyone.

10:50.320 --> 10:51.310
Takako!

10:56.990 --> 10:57.760
It's not...

10:59.800 --> 11:01.820
It's not over yet!

11:05.540 --> 11:09.200
Sasame wanted to save you, Takako!

11:10.010 --> 11:13.910
Even though he would be hated by his comrades, he tried to help you!

11:16.710 --> 11:19.820
Sasame wants you to live!

11:19.820 --> 11:26.790
If you give up now, all his wishes and your feelings will all disappear!

11:26.790 --> 11:28.860
Let's live, Takako!

11:28.860 --> 11:34.130
Everyone was born to live, to live and become happy!

11:36.000 --> 11:36.830
Damn it!

11:46.640 --> 11:47.700
Hayate!

11:48.510 --> 11:50.850
Hayate! Lower the shield!

11:50.850 --> 11:51.550
No!

11:51.550 --> 11:52.520
But you'll...

11:52.520 --> 11:53.500
No!

11:54.680 --> 11:55.650
Hayate!

11:59.760 --> 12:00.760
No...

12:03.790 --> 12:05.260
Hayate, you'll...

12:05.760 --> 12:07.900
You'll die!

12:07.900 --> 12:08.920
No...

12:17.810 --> 12:18.970
Hayate...

12:32.960 --> 12:35.390
Hayate! Hang on!

12:35.390 --> 12:37.290
Run!

12:37.290 --> 12:39.900
I can't any more...

12:39.900 --> 12:41.120
Hayate...

12:44.000 --> 12:45.900
Hurry, you idiot.

12:45.900 --> 12:48.100
Being an idiot is fine, because...

12:48.740 --> 12:50.810
Because I don't want to...

12:50.810 --> 12:54.140
I don't want to lose you.

12:54.140 --> 12:55.610
I don't want it to end.

12:55.610 --> 12:57.510
I want you all to be around,

12:57.510 --> 13:01.150
...to laugh, to cry with everyone.

13:01.150 --> 13:04.790
I don't want this world with everyone to disappear!

13:04.790 --> 13:06.310
I don't want to be beaten!

13:09.690 --> 13:11.160
Himeno...

13:27.510 --> 13:30.380
She became a Prétear by herself?

13:55.810 --> 13:57.070
Himeno!

14:00.210 --> 14:01.400
Takako!

14:11.120 --> 14:12.920
Great Tree of Fenrir,

14:12.920 --> 14:15.790
...if you want Leafe, I'll give you all you want,

14:15.790 --> 14:17.950
...but I won't be beaten!

14:33.610 --> 14:35.040
It disappeared.

14:35.040 --> 14:36.410
What's going on?

14:37.910 --> 14:38.850
Himeno!

14:38.850 --> 14:40.370
It must mean Himeno won!

14:41.850 --> 14:42.820
Himeno...

15:16.350 --> 15:19.340
That's the White Prétear.

16:02.470 --> 16:04.060
Leafe snow?

16:06.040 --> 16:07.160
This is...

16:08.200 --> 16:09.400
Himeno...

16:30.290 --> 16:32.400
Sasame, how did you...

16:32.400 --> 16:33.800
Himeno...

16:33.800 --> 16:34.500
Takako!

16:34.500 --> 16:37.300
Himeno resurrected him.

16:37.300 --> 16:38.460
Himeno did?

16:38.900 --> 16:40.030
I see.

16:51.910 --> 16:56.610
She became the legendary White Prétear by herself.

16:58.390 --> 16:59.950
The snow falls.

17:01.790 --> 17:04.350
The snow of miracles falls all over...

17:05.190 --> 17:07.700
...those with a weak heart.

17:07.700 --> 17:10.200
Those who have committed sins,

17:10.200 --> 17:13.130
...the white Leafe will heal them all.

17:14.940 --> 17:17.610
Himeno kept feeding it Leafe,

17:17.610 --> 17:20.240
...beat the enemy,

17:20.240 --> 17:22.850
...and forgave us.

17:22.850 --> 17:24.610
She gave everything she had.

17:26.420 --> 17:28.920
Why did it turn out that way?

17:28.920 --> 17:30.890
Why did this happen to only her?

17:31.750 --> 17:34.990
Unforgivable! I won't allow it!

17:34.990 --> 17:37.790
Wake up, Himeno! Himeno!

17:37.790 --> 17:38.590
Himeno!

17:38.590 --> 17:39.800
Stop it.

17:39.800 --> 17:41.660
You idiot!

17:41.660 --> 17:44.570
Himeno, you big fat idiot!

17:55.110 --> 17:57.450
We'll need to properly pay our respects.

17:57.450 --> 18:02.920
There'll never be another Prétear of her caliber again.

18:02.920 --> 18:04.990
Himeno, thank you.

18:04.990 --> 18:06.590
Sorry!

18:06.590 --> 18:10.530
Himeno, I'm a failure as a Knight.

18:11.390 --> 18:16.630
Although I knew it in my heart, I couldn't be honest.

18:21.770 --> 18:24.870
I'll keep the promise I couldn't now.

18:25.840 --> 18:27.400
The snow falls.

18:28.210 --> 18:30.450
The snow of miracles falls all over,

18:30.450 --> 18:34.710
...but there is one heart which has not been saved.

18:45.060 --> 18:46.620
Leafe...

18:47.860 --> 18:49.860
Please, just once more.

18:50.900 --> 18:53.870
Bring back that smile once more.

19:02.610 --> 19:06.280
If there is a miracle called love...

19:08.250 --> 19:11.500
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

19:08.250 --> 19:11.500
The boundless future stretches across the skies

19:11.600 --> 19:15.600
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

19:11.600 --> 19:15.600
And I am reborn anew

19:15.690 --> 19:22.760
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

19:15.690 --> 19:22.760
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

19:25.500 --> 19:26.500
There, done.

19:26.500 --> 19:27.100
Wow!

19:27.100 --> 19:28.840
That's amazing, Mawata!

19:28.840 --> 19:30.840
Say, teach me how to do that!

19:30.840 --> 19:32.360
Me too! Me too!

19:33.410 --> 19:34.380
All right.

19:34.910 --> 19:41.820
mizu ni yureru hanabira haruka tsuki o oikaketeku

19:34.910 --> 19:41.820
The flower petals swaying in the water chase after the distant moon

19:36.510 --> 19:38.210
Tipi, don't move.

19:38.210 --> 19:39.120
You're sure at it.

19:39.120 --> 19:41.520
Oh, hi, Dear! How are things going?

19:41.520 --> 19:44.220
Well, I couldn't really use this thing very well.

19:41.820 --> 19:46.860
miteta yume yori tooku e

19:41.820 --> 19:46.860
Going even farther than in my dreams

19:44.220 --> 19:45.960
I came to see you for a breather.

19:45.960 --> 19:46.990
My!

19:46.990 --> 19:50.790
I see, your father started to write novels again.

19:48.460 --> 19:55.500
iya na koto ga aru tabi hitori aoi sora o nagameru

19:48.460 --> 19:55.500
Whenever there's something I don't like, I gaze up at the blue skies

19:50.790 --> 19:53.300
Yeah, he even bought a laptop.

19:53.300 --> 19:56.400
I see. I wonder if I should become his student?

19:55.500 --> 20:00.600
yowai jibun ni maketakunai kara

19:55.500 --> 20:00.600
I don't want to give in to my weak parts

19:57.600 --> 20:01.200
Become a student, and thus begins the harsh training.

20:01.200 --> 20:04.370
Eventually, the feelings of fondness for one's master turn into love.

20:02.200 --> 20:09.050
sagashiteita atatakai ai no basho mo mirai mo

20:02.200 --> 20:09.050
The warm loving place and the future I was searching for

20:04.370 --> 20:05.110
"Teacher!"

20:05.110 --> 20:08.510
"No, you don't need to call me Teacher anymore, Miss Yayoi."

20:08.510 --> 20:11.710
"Really? Then please call me Yayoi as well."

20:09.050 --> 20:15.050
ki ga tsukeba mune no naka ni aru

20:09.050 --> 20:15.050
I suddenly realize they're inside my heart

20:11.710 --> 20:12.920
Rejected.

20:12.920 --> 20:14.120
Okay...

20:15.050 --> 20:18.350
tatta hitotsu moshi dekiru koto ga

20:15.050 --> 20:18.350
If there's even one thing I can do

20:16.490 --> 20:19.190
To think you followed me just because I gave you one video game,

20:18.350 --> 20:22.360
aru naraba mayowazuni kanaetai

20:18.350 --> 20:22.360
I want to do it without hesitating

20:19.190 --> 20:20.990
...you certainly are a kid.

20:20.990 --> 20:22.990
Mannen! Bathrobe!

20:22.360 --> 20:28.800
yuki no you ni kirei na kokoro wa dare ni de mo furitsumoru

20:22.360 --> 20:28.800
Anyone can have a heart as beautiful as snow

20:22.990 --> 20:23.990
Mannen!

20:23.990 --> 20:25.290
Don't you hear me?

20:25.290 --> 20:26.000
What?

20:28.800 --> 20:32.070
tomadou kedo koukai wa shinai

20:28.800 --> 20:32.070
I may be puzzled now, but I won't have any regrets

20:28.800 --> 20:32.070
Looks like he's too young to understand how attractive I am.

20:32.070 --> 20:36.040
tsuretette issho nara kowakunai

20:32.070 --> 20:36.040
Take me with you, with you I'm not afraid

20:34.500 --> 20:37.110
I've returned to the Awayuki Mansion.

20:36.040 --> 20:42.450
te ni furete nemutteta watashi ima me o samasu

20:36.040 --> 20:42.450
Touch my hand, and I'll wake up from my sleep

20:37.110 --> 20:39.410
Trapped in an unfamiliar land, not knowing the language,

20:39.410 --> 20:42.450
...nor being able to find sustenance, being made fun of for being bald...

20:42.450 --> 20:47.220
kokoro no naka hitori janai koto itai hodo

20:42.450 --> 20:47.220
Knowing that I'm not alone in my heart

20:42.450 --> 20:45.410
But I have spent ninety days believing in this very moment!

20:46.320 --> 20:48.620
Hey, that's my car!

20:47.220 --> 20:49.850
kono mune o atsuku suru

20:47.220 --> 20:49.850
Warms it so much that it hurts

20:48.620 --> 20:50.520
Then, take me to the parent company...

20:49.990 --> 20:52.760
hajimaru ne shinjiru koto kara

20:49.990 --> 20:52.760
It all begins from the point of believing

20:50.520 --> 20:52.020
Yes, Ma'am!

20:52.020 --> 20:53.720
...Yamada.

20:52.760 --> 20:56.060
kono kimochi ikiru akashi

20:52.760 --> 20:56.060
These feelings are proof of being alive

20:53.720 --> 20:56.190
Was the parent company in building number one?

20:56.190 --> 20:57.590
Mr. Yamada!

20:56.360 --> 20:59.660
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

20:56.360 --> 20:59.660
The endless future and the expanding skies

20:57.590 --> 21:01.960
When Mrs. Awayuki says the parent company, it's building number three!

20:59.660 --> 21:03.700
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

20:59.660 --> 21:03.700
Allow me to be reborn anew

21:01.960 --> 21:02.800
Tanaka!

21:03.700 --> 21:09.940
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

21:03.700 --> 21:09.940
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

21:04.170 --> 21:07.600
Ma'am, allow me to take care of this.

21:07.600 --> 21:10.740
Come to think of it, I want you as my driver, Tanaka.

21:09.940 --> 21:15.140
sono te tsunaide

21:09.940 --> 21:15.140
Holding hands with you

21:10.740 --> 21:12.210
Yes!

21:12.740 --> 21:13.510
Very well!

21:13.510 --> 21:15.410
Tanaka, took an unannounced leave of absence.

21:15.410 --> 21:17.070
Dock twelve months' pay.

21:20.350 --> 21:22.750
Oh, how delicious!

21:22.750 --> 21:24.890
Leafenia's returned to normal.

21:24.890 --> 21:26.220
Yeah, it's great.

21:27.060 --> 21:28.850
It's really great.

21:30.190 --> 21:31.960
That smile...

21:31.960 --> 21:34.020
There will be some natural disaster tomorrow.

21:40.300 --> 21:42.360
Hayate!

21:46.910 --> 21:48.640
How's Leafenia?

21:48.640 --> 21:50.010
Everything's all right now.

21:50.010 --> 21:52.380
I see. That's great.

21:53.820 --> 21:55.580
Well...

21:55.580 --> 21:57.020
Well, those two are...

22:08.200 --> 22:09.370
I see.

22:09.370 --> 22:11.960
It's great their feelings were communicated to each other.

22:13.300 --> 22:14.470
What is it?

22:14.470 --> 22:15.810
Nothing!

22:15.810 --> 22:18.810
They said Mawata's making a cake.

22:18.810 --> 22:19.780
Hey, wait!

22:20.640 --> 22:22.750
Hey! What are you doing?

22:22.750 --> 22:23.610
No!

22:27.020 --> 22:30.450
Oh, yeah! I've gotten quite good at the kendama!

22:30.450 --> 22:32.920
What, you still have that thing?

22:32.920 --> 22:35.990
That's horrible! I've been practicing all this time!

22:35.990 --> 22:37.060
Throw it away.

22:37.060 --> 22:37.660
No!

22:46.870 --> 22:50.340
The End
